@startuml StudyForgeF15ProviderSelection
actor Student
participant CoursePilotCommand
participant AiStatusController
participant AiProperties
participant RoutingLlmClient
participant OllamaLlmAdapter
participant GeminiLlmAdapter
Student -> AiStatusController: choose provider and model
AiStatusController -> AiStatusController: validate provider/model pair
alt valid choice
  AiStatusController -> AiProperties: update running configuration
  AiStatusController --> Student: selected provider/model confirmation
else invalid choice
  AiStatusController --> Student: validation error; current config retained
end
Student -> CoursePilotCLI: set provider/model environment for process
CoursePilotCLI -> AiStatusCommand: ai status
AiStatusCommand -> RoutingLlmClient: checkAvailability()
RoutingLlmClient -> AiProperties: read active provider
alt provider is Ollama
  RoutingLlmClient -> OllamaLlmAdapter: checkAvailability()
  OllamaLlmAdapter --> RoutingLlmClient: availability
else provider is Gemini
  RoutingLlmClient -> GeminiLlmAdapter: checkAvailability()
  GeminiLlmAdapter --> RoutingLlmClient: availability
end
RoutingLlmClient --> AiStatusCommand: provider/model status
AiStatusCommand --> Student: active configuration and availability
note over Student,AiStatusCommand
CLI selection is environment-based; there is no CLI switch command.
GUI changes apply to the running application session.
end note
@enduml
